---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: MigrationWave[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for coordinateRelease. Reconcile code, documentation, support guidance, and customer notices into one release state. Explain audience-specific consequences and verify that approved migrations and communications match the exact release artifact being promoted. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
